<li data-start="243" data-end="410" class="">
<p data-start="245" data-end="410" class=""><strong data-start="245" data-end="265">Chain-of-Thought</strong>, <strong data-start="267" data-end="286">self-refinement</strong>, <strong data-start="288" data-end="307">self-reflection</strong>, and <strong data-start="313" data-end="336">tool-use frameworks</strong> are examples of manually designed prompting and orchestration techniques.</p>
