<li data-start="548" data-end="729" class="">
<p data-start="550" data-end="729" class=""><strong data-start="550" data-end="573">MaestroMotif (2024)</strong>, intrinsic motivation, and <strong data-start="601" data-end="622">open-ended agents</strong> (e.g., Zhang et al., 2024) explore skill acquisition and learning via feedback or internally driven goals.</p>
