<li data-start="730" data-end="846" class="">
<p data-start="732" data-end="846" class="">Approaches like <strong data-start="748" data-end="756">OPRO</strong> and <strong data-start="761" data-end="778">Promptbreeder</strong> refine agent behavior through natural language prompt optimization.</p>
