<li data-start="1402" data-end="1542" class="">
<p data-start="1404" data-end="1542" class="">Claims to be the <strong data-start="1421" data-end="1430">first</strong> such work evaluated on <strong data-start="1454" data-end="1499">realistic software engineering benchmarks</strong> like SWE Bench Verified and LiveCodeBench.</p>
