<hr data-start="221" data-end="224" class="">
<h2 data-start="226" data-end="277" class=""><strong data-start="229" data-end="277">3.2 Full System Design &amp; Execution Framework</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start="279" data-end="316" class=""><strong data-start="283" data-end="316">LLM Context Window (Figure 2)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="317" data-end="379" class="">SICA's agent leverages a structured context window comprising:</p>
<ul data-start="381" data-end="719">
<li data-start="381" data-end="490" class="">
<p data-start="383" data-end="401" class=""><strong data-start="383" data-end="400">System Prompt</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="404" data-end="490">
<li data-start="404" data-end="425" class="">
<p data-start="406" data-end="425" class="">Agentâ€™s role, goals</p>
</li>
<li data-start="428" data-end="460" class="">
<p data-start="430" data-end="460" class="">Tool &amp; sub-agent documentation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="463" data-end="490" class="">
<p data-start="465" data-end="490" class="">System-level instructions</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="492" data-end="591" class="">
<p data-start="494" data-end="510" class=""><strong data-start="494" data-end="509">Core Prompt</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="513" data-end="591">
<li data-start="513" data-end="536" class="">
<p data-start="515" data-end="536" class="">Problem specification</p>
</li>
<li data-start="539" data-end="567" class="">
<p data-start="541" data-end="567" class="">Current open file contents</p>
</li>
<li data-start="570" data-end="591" class="">
<p data-start="572" data-end="591" class="">Directory structure</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="593" data-end="719" class="">
<p data-start="595" data-end="618" class=""><strong data-start="595" data-end="617">Assistant Messages</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="621" data-end="719">
<li data-start="621" data-end="649" class="">
<p data-start="623" data-end="649" class="">Chain-of-thought reasoning</p>
