</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="721" data-end="869" class="">This context organization supports effective memory usage and dynamic tool invocation, while aiding context management via the key-value (KV) cache.</p>
<hr data-start="871" data-end="874" class="">
<h3 data-start="876" data-end="894" class=""><strong data-start="880" data-end="894">Sub-Agents</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="895" data-end="1236">
<li data-start="895" data-end="992" class="">
<p data-start="897" data-end="992" class="">Sub-agents are <strong data-start="912" data-end="948">LLM routines with specific roles</strong> (e.g., coding, reasoning, problem-solving).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="993" data-end="1236" class="">
<p data-start="995" data-end="1004" class="">Benefits:</p>
<ul data-start="1007" data-end="1236">
<li data-start="1007" data-end="1097" class="">
<p data-start="1009" data-end="1097" class=""><strong data-start="1009" data-end="1021">Autonomy</strong>: Tasks are broken down hierarchically and executed without human oversight.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1100" data-end="1236" class="">
<p data-start="1102" data-end="1236" class=""><strong data-start="1102" data-end="1124">Context Management</strong>: Each sub-agent uses isolated context, and returns a <strong data-start="1178" data-end="1196">summary string</strong>, optimizing the parentâ€™s memory budget.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1238" data-end="1241" class="">
<h3 data-start="1243" data-end="1272" class=""><strong data-start="1247" data-end="1272">Asynchronous Overseer</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="1273" data-end="1608">
<li data-start="1273" data-end="1389" class="">
<p data-start="1275" data-end="1330" class="">A <strong data-start="1277" data-end="1303">concurrent LLM monitor</strong> that tracks execution for:</p>
<ul data-start="1333" data-end="1389">
<li data-start="1333" data-end="1353" class="">
<p data-start="1335" data-end="1353" class="">Pathological loops</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1356" data-end="1389" class="">
<p data-start="1358" data-end="1389" class="">Deviations from task objectives</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1390" data-end="1457" class="">
<p data-start="1392" data-end="1457" class="">Receives a rich <strong data-start="1408" data-end="1436">callgraph + event stream</strong> from the main agent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1458" data-end="1535" class="">
<p data-start="1460" data-end="1478" class="">Can intervene via:</p>
<ul data-start="1481" data-end="1535">
<li data-start="1481" data-end="1498" class="">
<p data-start="1483" data-end="1498" class="">Inline messages</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1501" data-end="1535" class="">
<p data-start="1503" data-end="1535" class="">Hard interruption (cancellation)</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1536" data-end="1608" class="">
<p data-start="1538" data-end="1608" class="">Critical for long-running, complex tasks like self-improvement cycles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
