<hr data-start="2398" data-end="2401" class="">
<h2 data-start="2403" data-end="2425" class=""><strong data-start="2406" data-end="2425">Key Innovations</strong></h2>
<ol data-start="2427" data-end="2953">
<li data-start="2427" data-end="2621" class="">
<p data-start="2430" data-end="2466" class=""><strong data-start="2430" data-end="2465">Self-contained self-improvement</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2470" data-end="2621">
<li data-start="2470" data-end="2531" class="">
<p data-start="2472" data-end="2531" class="">The same agent both <em data-start="2492" data-end="2502">performs</em> tasks and <em data-start="2513" data-end="2530">improves itself</em>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2535" data-end="2621" class="">
<p data-start="2537" data-end="2621" class="">Fully general-purpose: edits <em data-start="2566" data-end="2584">its own codebase</em>, not just prompts or abstract logic.</p>
