</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="2623" data-end="2723" class="">
<p data-start="2626" data-end="2669" class=""><strong data-start="2626" data-end="2668">Hierarchical agent/sub-agent structure</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="2673" data-end="2723">
