[He] canâ€™t even write a fucking email without using Chat GPT...

Bradley is a veteran artist who works at a AAA video game studio. They describe the company as having been founded relatively recently, with investment coming from traditional AAA executives who â€œwant to make money, and they are trying to figure out what game to make for thatâ€. 

They say their projectâ€™s art direction has been largely fuelled by AI prompts and generated imagery, all driven by their head Art Director, who is himself an experienced video game artist, but who now â€œcanâ€™t even write a fucking email without using Chat GPTâ€. 

