<p data-start="530" data-end="572" class=""><strong data-start="530" data-end="572">Self-Improvement in LLM Coding Agents:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="576" data-end="944">
<li data-start="576" data-end="775" class="">
<p data-start="578" data-end="775" class="">The core innovation of the SICA is that the agent can autonomously edit its own codebase. This self-improvement extends across performance metrics, including speed, cost, and benchmark performance.</p>
