<li data-start="3103" data-end="3310" class="">
<p data-start="3105" data-end="3310" class=""><strong data-start="3105" data-end="3127">Native Development</strong>: For iOS and Android, you can use the respective platformâ€™s tools (like UIKit for iOS or Android Views) to adjust text size based on stress input from sensors, speech, or user input.</p>
</li>
