oice qualities.</p>
<h3 data-start="434" data-end="458" class="">How This Could Work:</h3>
<ol data-start="460" data-end="1506">
<li data-start="460" data-end="831" class="">
<p data-start="463" data-end="489" class=""><strong data-start="463" data-end="489">Voice/Pitch Detection:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="493" data-end="831">
<li data-start="493" data-end="596" class="">
<p data-start="495" data-end="596" class="">In addition to detecting stress, you can also analyze the <strong data-start="553" data-end="562">pitch</strong> and <strong data-start="567" data-end="575">tone</strong> of the spoken words.</p>
