</ul>
<hr data-start="747" data-end="750" class="">
<h4 data-start="752" data-end="772" class=""><strong data-start="757" data-end="772">2. Pipeline</strong></h4>
<p data-start="774" data-end="800" class=""><strong data-start="774" data-end="800">Step 1: Parse &amp; Ground</strong></p>
<ul data-start="801" data-end="950">
<li data-start="801" data-end="852" class="">
<p data-start="803" data-end="852" class="">NLP parses the sentence for entities and actions.</p>
