</li>
<li data-start="1602" data-end="1706" class="">
<p data-start="1604" data-end="1706" class="">The <strong data-start="1608" data-end="1670">pretraining on literature, philosophy, and real-world text</strong> is a proxy for historical learning.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1707" data-end="1879" class="">
<p data-start="1709" data-end="1879" class="">However, even with that, such systems can only approximate a fragment of historical consciousness unless designed to <em data-start="1826" data-end="1878">simulate or model time-based evolution of concepts</em>.</p>
