<hr data-start="775" data-end="778" class="">
<h3 data-start="780" data-end="833" class="">ðŸ¤– Van Dervenâ€™s Multimodal Cognitive System (MCS)</h3>
<ul data-start="835" data-end="1255">
<li data-start="835" data-end="933" class="">
<p data-start="837" data-end="933" class=""><strong data-start="837" data-end="853">Core Premise</strong>: <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Proposes an AGI architecture that integrates visual thought simulation and meta-cognitive reflection, enabling the system to process both concrete and abstract concepts.</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="935" data-end="1043" class="">
<p data-start="937" data-end="1043" class=""><strong data-start="937" data-end="963">Technical Architecture</strong>: <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Incorporates modules for natural language parsing, semantic association, internal 3D scene construction, and iterative learning loops.</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1045" data-end="1153" class="">
<p data-start="1047" data-end="1153" class=""><strong data-start="1047" data-end="1073">Ethical Considerations</strong>: <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Designed to recognize and adapt to ethical frameworks, with the potential to develop its own ethical reasoning.</span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1155" data-end="1255" class="">
