<li data-start="1291" data-end="1398" class="">
<p data-start="1293" data-end="1398" class=""><strong data-start="1293" data-end="1318">Motivation and Agency</strong>: <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Glasser emphasizes intrinsic human motivation, while MCS aims to emulate such motivation through computational models.</span></p>
