</li>
<li data-start="1503" data-end="1607" class="">
<p data-start="1505" data-end="1607" class=""><strong data-start="1505" data-end="1527">Ethical Frameworks</strong>: <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Glasser's model is grounded in humanistic ethics, whereas MCS seeks to incorporate and possibly develop ethical reasoning within an artificial system.</span></p>
