<div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="307" data-end="2830" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="307" data-end="510"><tr data-start="307" data-end="510"><th data-start="307" data-end="338" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="309" data-end="329">Conceptual Layer</strong></th><th data-start="338" data-end="357" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="340" data-end="356">Powers (PCT)</strong></th><th data-start="357" data-end="400" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="359" data-end="393">Glasser (Stations of the Mind)</strong></th><th data-start="400" data-end="447" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="402" data-end="422">Active Inference</strong></th><th data-start="447" data-end="510" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="449" data-end="476">AGI Systems (e.g., MCS)</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="714" data-end="2830"><tr data-start="714" data-end="944"><td data-start="714" data-end="744" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="716" data-end="734">Core Mechanism</strong></td><td data-start="744" data-end="787" data-col-size="md">Control of perception via feedback loops</td><td data-start="787" data-end="834" data-col-size="md">Behavior is an attempt to control perception</td><td data-start="834" data-end="881" data-col-size="md">Free energy minimization through prediction</td><td data-start="881" data-end="944" data-col-size="md">Visual + semantic modeling with meta-cognitive correction</td></tr><tr data-start="945" data-end="1204"><td data-start="945" data-end="975" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="947" data-end="964">Loop Function</strong></td><td data-start="975" data-end="1032" data-col-size="md">Compare reference with perception, act to reduce error</td><td data-start="1032" data-end="1094" data-col-size="md">Compare internal quality picture with reality, act to align</td><td data-start="1094" data-end="1141" data-col-size="md">Predict sensory input, update beliefs or act</td><td data-start="1141" data-end="1204" data-col-size="md">Internal simulation â†’ perception â†’ error correction</td></tr><tr data-start="1205" data-end="1435"><td data-start="1205" data-end="1235" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1207" data-end="1225">Internal Model</strong></td><td data-start="1235" data-end="1278" data-col-size="md">Hierarchical perceptual reference levels</td><td data-start="1278" data-end="1324" data-col-size="md">Quality World, inner pictures, values</td><td data-start="1324" data-end="1372" data-col-size="md">Generative model of world and self</td><td data-start="1372" data-end="1435" data-col-size="md">Visual thought graph, symbolic map, memory embedding</td></tr><tr data-start="1436" data-end="1667"><td data-start="1436" data-end="1466" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1438" data-end="1459">Action Generation</strong></td><td data-start="1466" data-end="1511" data-col-size="md">Action selected to reduce perceptual error</td><td data-start="1511" data-end="1557" data-col-size="md">Choice behavior aligned with internal goals</td><td data-start="1557" data-end="1604" data-col-size="md">Action policies chosen to minimize surprise</td><td data-start="1604" data-end="1667" data-col-size="md">Behavior/action modules simulate outcomes &amp; execute</td></tr><tr data-start="1668" data-end="1899"><td data-start="1668" data-end="1698" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1670" data-end="1689">Learning/Update</strong></td><td data-start="1698" data-end="1742" data-col-size="md">Reorganizes when error persists</td><td data-start="1742" data-end="1788" data-col-size="md">Adjusts pictures/choices after failure</td><td data-start="1788" data-end="1836" data-col-size="md">Bayesian update of priors</td><td data-start="1836" data-end="1899" data-col-size="md">Iterative learning loop &amp; contradiction resolution</td></tr><tr data-start="1900" data-end="2129"><td data-start="1900" d