<li data-start="2949" data-end="3063" class="">
<p data-start="2951" data-end="3063" class=""><strong data-start="2951" data-end="2971">Active Inference</strong> adds probabilistic modeling and is mathematically grounded in free energy and neuroscience.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3064" data-end="3256" class="">
<p data-start="3066" data-end="3256" class=""><strong data-start="3066" data-end="3088">Modern AGI systems</strong> (like the MCS) often unknowingly <strong data-start="3122" data-end="3168">recreate these same feedback architectures</strong>, using modern tools like neural networks, symbolic systems, and internal visual models.</p>
