order-token-border-default relative aspect-square max-h-48 w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] sm:w-[calc((100%-1rem)/4)] md:shrink"><button class="relative aspect-square overflow-hidden h-full w-full"><div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><img alt="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/50e0c114e4b03955129f1013/1666904176236-U8OYTAQT3ATMKFWOPHZ1/levinthumb.png?format=2500w" class="bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover" src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/50e0c114e4b03955129f1013/1666904176236-U8OYTAQT3ATMKFWOPHZ1/levinthumb.png?format=2500w" style="object-position: 100% 50%;"></div></button></div><div class="border-token-border-default relative aspect-square max-h-48 w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] sm:w-[calc((100%-1rem)/4)] md:shrink"><button class="relative aspect-square overflow-hidden h-full w-full"><div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><img alt="https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/493866/fpsyg-10-02688-HTML/image_m/fpsyg-10-02688-g004.jpg" class="bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover" src="https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/493866/fpsyg-10-02688-HTML/image_m/fpsyg-10-02688-g004.jpg" style="object-position: 50% 0%;"></div></button></div><div class="border-token-border-default relative aspect-square max-h-48 w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] sm:w-[calc((100%-1rem)/4)] md:shrink rounded-e-xl"><button class="relative aspect-square overflow-hidden h-full w-full"><div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><img alt="https://talkstar-photos.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/49a47da2-dd4a-4103-b7c9-5e2e302c079b/MichaelLevin_2020-embed.jpg" class="bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover" src="https://talkstar-photos.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/49a47da2-dd4a-4103-b7c9-5e2e302c079b/MichaelLevin_2020-embed.jpg" style="object-position: 12.1% 50%;"></div></button></div></div>
<p data-start="40" data-end="152" class=""><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Michael Levin, a prominent biologist and director of the Allen Discovery Center at Tufts University, has significantly advanced our understanding of developmental biology through his research on bioelectricity and cellular intelligence.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">While he has not explicitly coined the term "minimum viable organism," his work explores concepts that align with this idea.</span><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]"><a href="https://newatlas.com/biology/levin-bioelectricity-cellular-intelligence-dna/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Wikipedia</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+3</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">New Atlas</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+3</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10%);"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">templeton.org</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+3</span></span></span></a></span></p>
<h3 data-start="154" data-end="198" class="">Bioelectricity and Cellular Intelligence</h3>
<p data-start="200" data-end="357" class=""><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Levin's research challenges the traditional view that DNA solely dictates an organism's form and function.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">He posits that cells possess intrinsic intelligence and can communicate through bioelectrical signals, which guide development, regeneration, and even the formation of complex structures</span> .</p>
<h3 data-start="359" data-end="406" class="">Xenobots: A Step Towards Minimal Life Forms</h3>
<p data-start="408" data-end="567" class=""><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">In collaboration with other researchers, Levin co-discovered Xenobotsâ€”living robots constructed from frog skin cells.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">These organisms can move, heal themselves, and even reproduce, demonstrating that minimal living systems can emerge from simple cellular assemblies</span> .<span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Levin_%28biologist%29?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Tufts Now</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+3</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Wikipedia</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+3</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10%);"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Forms of life, forms of mind</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+3</span></span></span></a></span><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]"><a href="https://drmichaellevin.org/resources/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">drmichaellevin.org</span></span></span></a></span></p>
<h3 data-start="569" data-end="614" class="">Implications for Minimum Viable Organisms</h3>
<p data-start="616" data-end="775" class=""><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">Levin's work suggests that the essence of life may not reside in complex genetic codes but in the bioelectrical patterns that govern cellular behavior.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">This perspective opens the possibility of creating minimal life forms by manipulating cellular communication pathways, potentially leading to novel forms of life with specific functions</span> .<span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]"><a href="https://newatlas.com/biology/levin-bioelectricity-cellular-intelligence-dna/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">New Atlas</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between absolute" style="opacity: 0; transform: translateX(10%);"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Wikipedia</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></p>
<h3 data-start="777" data-end="791" class="">Conclusion</h3>
<p data-start="793" data-end="911" class=""><span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">While Michael Levin has not specifically defined "minimum viable organisms," his research on bioelectricity and cellular intelligence provides a framework for understanding and potentially creating minimal life forms.</span> <span class="relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out">By focusing on the bioelectrical signals that govern cellular behavior, Levin's work paves the way for innovations in regenerative medicine, synthetic biology, and our understanding of life's fundamental principles.</span><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]"><a href="https://newatlas.com/biology/levin-bioelectricity-cellular-intelligence-dna/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[0.5625em] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-full grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">New Atlas</span></span></span></a></span></p>
