<h3 data-start="223" data-end="270" class="">1. <strong data-start="230" data-end="270">Thermostat = Basic Perceptual System</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="271" data-end="637">
<li data-start="271" data-end="453" class="">
<p data-start="273" data-end="453" class="">The thermostat represents <strong data-start="299" data-end="325">homeostatic regulation</strong>â€”a system that perceives a variable (temperature), compares it to a set point (a model or goal), and acts to minimize the error.</p>
