<h3 data-start="102" data-end="166" class=""><strong data-start="106" data-end="148">1. Integrated Information Theory (IIT)</strong> â€“ <em data-start="151" data-end="166">Giulio Tononi</em></h3>
<p data-start="168" data-end="258" class=""><strong data-start="168" data-end="182">Core Idea:</strong><br data-start="182" data-end="185">
