<li data-start="290" data-end="474" class="">
<p data-start="292" data-end="474" class=""><strong data-start="292" data-end="306">Daisyworld</strong> itself likely has <em data-start="325" data-end="334">low phi</em> (IIT's measure of integrated information), since its components (daisies) don't internally integrate states or exchange rich information.</p>
