<li data-start="475" data-end="682" class="">
<p data-start="477" data-end="682" class="">However, <strong data-start="486" data-end="492">if</strong> daisies could "sense" more, "communicate," or "remember" across generations (via epigenetics, for example), the system might begin to show <strong data-start="632" data-end="664">minimal consciousness traits</strong> in the IIT sense.</p>
